---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Use | Create With Soumay"
  description="Read the terms governing your use of Create With Soumay's AI prompts, creator resources, guides and website."
>
  <article class="legal container">

    <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>

    <h1>Terms of Use</h1>

    <p class="updated">
      Last updated: September 12, 2026
    </p>

    <p>
      Welcome to Create With Soumay. These Terms of Use ("Terms") govern your
      access to and use of <strong>createwithsoumay.store</strong> and the
      content, resources and features made available through the website.
    </p>

    <p>
      By accessing or using Create With Soumay, you agree to these Terms. If you
      do not agree with these Terms, please do not use the website.
    </p>

    <h2>1. About Create With Soumay</h2>

    <p>
      Create With Soumay provides AI image prompts, creator resources, guides,
      articles and related informational content intended to help users
      with creative projects and content creation.
    </p>

    <p>
      Create With Soumay does not operate or control the third-party AI platforms,
      image-generation tools, social media platforms or other services
      that users may choose to use with the information provided on this
      website.
    </p>

