      intended project.
    </p>

    <p>
      You may use prompts provided by Create With Soumay with third-party AI tools,
      subject to the terms, licenses and policies of those third-party
      services.
    </p>

    <h2>3. AI-generated content</h2>

    <p>
      Create With Soumay provides prompts and guidance rather than the final
      output generated by third-party AI systems. Results can vary
      depending on the AI model, platform, settings, reference images and
      other inputs used.
    </p>

    <p>
      Create With Soumay does not guarantee that an AI-generated result will
      be accurate, identical to a reference image, suitable for a particular
      purpose, free from unwanted elements, or available for unrestricted
      commercial use.
    </p>

    <p>
      You are responsible for reviewing generated content before
      publishing, distributing, selling or otherwise using it.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Third-party platforms and services</h2>

    <p>
      Create With Soumay may reference or link to third-party platforms, tools,
      websites and services. Those services are operated independently
      and may have their own terms, privacy policies, pricing,
      restrictions and content rules.
    </p>

    <p>
      Your use of a third-party service is governed by that service's
      applicable terms and policies. Create With Soumay is not responsible for
      changes, interruptions, availability, pricing, policies or
      functionality of third-party services.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Accuracy and availability</h2>

    <p>
      We aim to provide useful and accurate information, but creator
      platforms, AI tools, features, pricing and other online services can
      change over time.
    </p>

    <p>
      We therefore do not guarantee that every article, prompt,
      recommendation, platform feature or third-party service described
      on Create With Soumay will remain current or available.
    </p>

    <p>
      We may update, modify, remove or replace website content and
      features at any time.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Prohibited use</h2>

    <p>
      You agree not to use Create With Soumay in a way that violates applicable
      laws or regulations, infringes the rights of others, interferes
      with the operation or security of the website, or attempts to gain
      unauthorized access to systems or data.
    </p>

    <p>
      You are also responsible for ensuring that your use of prompts and
      any resulting content complies with the policies of the AI platform
      or other service you use.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Intellectual property and third-party rights</h2>

    <p>
      You are responsible for checking intellectual-property, publicity,
